WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Step 1: Start a Stage Lab project. Start building → Key Stage 2 → Stage Lab.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.200
Step 2: Snap blocks together. Drag blocks out of the coloured categories; they click into place.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:21.200
Step 3: Press Run. Every character runs its own blocks. Stop puts them back.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.600
Step 4: Add characters and costumes. Add makes a new character; Costume changes its look.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:33.800
Step 5: Choose a backdrop. Backdrops → Choose a backdrop, or paint your own.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:39.400
Step 6: Key Stage 1: picture blocks. Tap a picture block to add it after the green flag. No reading needed.
